{"id":"30f3283b9dedba60","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-simple-set.md","title":"Simple Set","display":"df-simple-set — Simple Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-simple-set","aliases":["90-df-simple-set"],"display":"df-simple-set — Simple Set","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-simple-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-simple-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple-set — Simple Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1316be710802d6a1\" href=\"?note=1316be710802d6a1\" title=\"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\">\\(W_e:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>；固定编号满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}\\)</span>，依据为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>，不是另一套任意有效列表。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(S \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}_1\\)</span> (c.e. unary-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1316be710802d6a1\" href=\"?note=1316be710802d6a1\" title=\"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (fixed effective enumeration of c.e. subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}\\)</span> (simple-set predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}set}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Simple}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RE}_1(S)\\land\n|\\mathbb N\\setminus S|=\\infty\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus S\\rightarrow|W_e|&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}set}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Simple}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RE}_1(S)\\land\n|\\mathbb N\\setminus S|=\\infty\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus S\\rightarrow|W_e|&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}(S)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>是简单集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{S}\">\\(\\bar{S}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>的补集（非c.e.且无限）</li>\n<li>简单集是非递归的c.e.集，但不是创造集</li>\n<li>Post的简单集构造展示了不完全归约 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"1316be710802d6a1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"1802adc1900d4b34","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnch