d\n|\\mathbb N\\setminus S|=\\infty\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus S\\rightarrow|W_e|<\\infty\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{S}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1430,"backlinks":[{"id":"279ca56a651294c7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{HSimple}$、$\\mathrm{Simple}$、$\\mathrm{Creative}$ 见 [[90-df-hypersimple-set]]、[[90-df-simple-set]]、[[90-df-creative-set]]。"},{"id":"a3c41e3442057746","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Simple}$ 见 [[90-df-simple-set]]，$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。$\\overline H$ 在下式定义。"},{"id":"ca9ad86d98eb5bc2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Simple}$ 见 [[90-df-simple-set]]，同一 $W_e$ 见 [[90-df-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-simple-set]]、[[90-prop-simple-immune]]、[[90-df-hypersimple-set]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-